abstract: >-
  Maple worksheets and MATLAB scripts for the quasinormal modes of scalar, electromagnetic and vector-type
  gravitational perturbations of the Morris–Thorne wormhole. A Chebyshev collocation at 200 digits, across the whole
  wormhole or from the throat with the conditions that select the even or the odd overtones, gives a quadratic
  eigenvalue problem solved with polyeig in double or multiple precision; a third-order WKB worksheet gives estimates
  for comparison.
